CHANGED.text:
The password for the Glazecalc account {account} was just changed, and every device that was signed in has been signed out.

If this was you, there is nothing else to do. If not, reset your password right away at {forgot}

-- 
Glazecalc, {app}

CHANGE_NOTICE.text:
A change of email was just asked for on the Glazecalc account {account}. A link was sent to the new address, and the change happens only when that link is opened.

If this was you, there is nothing else to do. If not, someone may know your password: reset it right away at {forgot}

-- 
Glazecalc, {app}

CONFIRM_CHANGE.text:
